  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd like to request for a feature that would allow users to rebind general use keys for their own needs.\nThe shift launch menu does not rebind any keys (atleast for desktop keyboard) as far as i've tested, and i would appreciate the possibility of rebinding keys such as:\nMovement Keybinds;\nGesture Keybinds;\nSafe Mode Keybind;\nMicrophone Enable Keybind. and others.\nI'd like to propose either a menu function that'd allow users to rebind keys in-game, or much like the particle and dynamic bone limiter configuration file, there be a keymap configuration file, in which if an entry does not exist, it would not replace anything.\nThank you for your time.\nRegards.",
